<v Mike Hall>Hi, it's Mike with UGtastic . I'm here at GOTO Conference 2014. I 'm sitting here with Cindy Sprague, who helps with GOTO Conference. And help is a big word. She's been involved in helping to decide the location, the finally deciding on Chicago, and all that forward searching, scouting for locations, and then a lot of other stuff that's involved. And I just want to say thank you very much for taking the time to speak with me. Certainly. So what does helping mean?

