<v Cindy Sprague>So I, you know, I will send an email to, you know, all the organizers of a given meetup and say, Hey, you know, we'd love to pair with you. We'll bring you a speaker and we'll pay for it. And all we want to do is to be able to, you know, stick up our go-to banner. You know, it's all about the speaker as opposed to go-to.

